1200 Version - HAND-WRITTEN FIXTURE. Every value below is invented.
# Not a byte of this file came from any X-Plane installation. ZZZZ and ZZZY are
# in the ICAO "no location" block, and the coordinates are round numbers so the
# expected geodesy is checkable with a calculator.
#
# ZZZZ: two runway ends (09/27) along the 40N parallel, threshold at exactly
#       40 00 00 N 003 00 00 W, no displacement, one gate and one tie-down.
# ZZZY: a 300 m displaced threshold on 18, plus a hangar and a misc stand.
# ZZZH: a heliport header (row 17). It must NOT be indexed as an airport, and
#       its ramp start must not attach itself to ZZZY.

